						</segment>
					</unit>
					<unit id="solution">
						<segment>
							<source><pc id="c1" type="ui" subType="swi18n:par" swi18n:slot="children">To find <ph id="c2" type="ui" subType="swi18n:inline-math"/> we look at the sum of the moments around point <ph id="c3" type="ui" subType="swi18n:inline-math"/>. In this case <ph id="c4" type="ui" subType="swi18n:inline-math"/> and <ph id="c5" type="ui" subType="swi18n:inline-math"/> have no effect. This gives us the equilibrium equation<ph id="c6" type="ui" subType="swi18n:block-math"/>The solution follows as<ph id="c7" type="ui" subType="swi18n:block-math"/></pc></source>
